    body: 'Start a free personal blog or LinkedIn newsletter, pitch guest posts to small brands or startups, and study working writers whose style you admire. HubSpot Academy\'s free content marketing course covers strategy fundamentals at zero cost — the real gap most paid courses fill is editorial feedback, not the theory itself.',
